            </creation>
            <history xml:id="history_9dd1f4b0">
               <p xml:id="idm315">In the early 1860s Gade apparently received an invitation to contribute to a collection planned by the Society for the advancement of music in Rotterdam. When Gade in 1864 sent these four album leaves it was too late. The publication had ceased three years earlier due to lack of material. Instead he had nos. 3 and 4 published in a revised form (NWGW 113) and (NWGW 116).</p>
            </history>
